  "notes": "Active studio monitor. Specifications list 1 x XLR analog input. XLR gender not stated (female by convention for inputs). Controls from the 8040B/8050B operating manual: input sensitivity control (factory -6 dBu, fully clockwise), ISS DISABLE, switch groups TREBLE TILT (+2 to -4 dB and MUTE at 15 kHz), DESKTOP (-4 dB at 160 Hz), BASS TILT (0 to -6 dB at 100 Hz and MUTE) and BASS ROLL-OFF (0 to -6 dB at 35 Hz), power switch. MUTE silences that driver only. These switches shape the frequency response; they do not change where the signal goes. All off = flat (factory setting).",
